{"skill":{"slug":"cn-web-search","displayName":"CN Web Search"},"version":{"version":"2.4.0","createdAt":1776612998023,"changelog":"新增11个海外信息源：美股深度(Seeking Alpha/Finviz/Macrotrends)、全球宏观(BEA/Treasury/Census)、散户情绪(Reddit WSB)、Trump推文(Nitter)、Pre-IPO(IPOScoop/StockAnalysis/CB Insights)","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":654,"sha256":"52456fbe14df56e0755001f08ab78169aa9dba9e8b5a8fcd919dcb383cfc4993","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":12344,"sha256":"f2df065c6e652b82dbd5ba732a95d612400a9c3e5b9c102c7e6d4ef0713256d7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"_meta.json","size":132,"sha256":"f380217d3b5f887c270c73669b5ba3c3e7d9d26e824d11373b29696d6ad1c606","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"package.json","size":392,"sha256":"4725d2f6e24236d44f2d758a4547f037ec0496ffc361f35fe699052ad1b66a51","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1790,"sha256":"0b3b1f0481e5cef1a8b5b6c747819a402e4ca15ebf1d11320d12574e66f1d4d3","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789150869198,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"3c9042885829bd830850395e576ef28e779b9c1151f0c8b041631f2d96458d11","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/3c9042885829bd830850395e576ef28e779b9c1151f0c8b041631f2d96458d11","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085912970},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":30,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789150869198},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed Markdown-only web search skill that sends user search terms to listed third-party search and content sites.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network fetching of search pages is proportionate to a web-search skill, with no executable scripts, dependencies, local indexing, or broad environment access found.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation is documented as a normal clawhub install command, but version metadata is inconsistent across SKILL.md, package.json, and _meta.json; this is packaging hygiene rather than security-impacting behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill lists many external URLs and examples but does not include hidden role changes, prompt overrides, local file access, command execution, or credential handling; users should understand queries may be sent to third-party sites.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, privilege escalation, memory writes, scheduled tasks, tool wrapping, or system modifications were present in the inspected artifacts.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Chinese-oriented multi-engine web search, and the capability is limited to documented web_fetch examples for search, finance, technical, encyclopedia, macro, and IPO sources.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with your search terms being sent to the selected external search engines and content sites. Avoid searching confidential, personal, legal, medical, or sensitive business information through broad third-party engines.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese documentation and package description match the skill's stated Chinese web-search focus; this is not evidence of hidden or purpose-mismatched behavior.\n[SQP-1] expected: The README example trigger uses ordinary Chinese search phrasing, but it still asks to search and the resulting behavior is limited to documented web_fetch search activity.\n[SQP-2] expected: Sending query terms to third-party search/content sites is inherent to the disclosed multi-engine search purpose; the missing privacy warning merits user guidance but does not create a Review-level concern by itself.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789150869198}}}}}